  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "SDK: 2021.07.08.15.57\nWhen using SetProgramVariable to change a variable on another UdonBehavior, private variables won't appear in the dropdown. Making the variable public will make it appear in the dropdown, and if you select that variable in the dropdown and then set it to private again it will appear as \"MISSING! was x\" where x is the name of the variable. Leaving it like this will STILL WORK, it can functionally change private variables like it could before. Private variables just don't appear in the dropdown.",
